= 15 October 2023 — The Sejm is elected

Polls close after a record campaign. The Left's result will decide its public
funding, the size of every internal caucus, and whether a democratic government
needs its votes. The constitutional sequence follows: the outgoing cabinet,
the first sitting, the President's nominee and up to three attempts to form a
government that can win confidence.

