@razem_split_2024
title: Razem prepares to leave
subtitle: Five parliamentarians choose cooperation; the party chooses opposition
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 27
order: 11
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2024 and month = 10 and razem_split = 0 and government_party != "pis"
on-arrival: news_headline = "Housing, health and coalition responsibility split Razem"

= October 2024 — One party becomes three relationships

If the split follows its historical course, it creates a pro-cooperation group
of former Razem MPs, a separate Razem circle, and a governing New Left that
wants both groups' voters. The split can be avoided only if earlier autonomy
and policy delivery created enough trust for a binding outside-support
agreement.

The abortion defeat is now part of that trust test. The party promised **[+
movement_reckoning_result +]**. [? if abortion_cabinet_deadline = 1: Razem can
measure the promised spring vote against cabinet participation; another vague
programme guarantee will not substitute for it.?]

- @razem_historical
- @razem_protocol
- @razem_absorb

@razem_historical
title: Accept the split and negotiate orderly parliamentary separation
on-arrival: {!
const razemCurrentSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.razem_seats) || 0)
);
const cooperativeSeats = Math.min(5, razemCurrentSeats);
const oppositionSeats = Math.max(0, razemCurrentSeats - cooperativeSeats);
const razemExitStrength = Math.max(
    1,
    Number(Q.razem_strength) || 0
);
Q.razem_split = 1;
Q.razem_in_left_club = 0;
Q.razem_opposition_circle = 1;
Q.razem_active = 0;
Q.razem_in_left = 0;
Q.razem_party_formed = 1;
Q.razem_party_relation = 42;
Q.razem_exit_strength = razemExitStrength;
Q.razem_strength = 0;
Q.razem_dissent = 100;
Q.progressives_strength += razemExitStrength * 0.60;
Q.labor_strength += razemExitStrength * 0.15;
Q.party_unity -= 8;
Q.razem_cooperation -= 10;
Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) - oppositionSeats);
Q.razem_party_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.razem_party_seats) || 0) + oppositionSeats;
Q.left_new_generation_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_new_generation_seats) || 0) +
    cooperativeSeats;
Q.razem_seats = 0;
Q.zandberg_advisor = 0;
Q.zawisza_advisor = 0;
Q.matysiak_advisor = 0;
Q.seat_subvention_seats = Q.left_seats;
Q.news_headline =
    "Razem leaves the club while its cooperative minority joins the governing left";
!}
go-to: poland_event_queue

@razem_protocol
title: Offer funded milestones and a binding outside-support protocol
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources and strong prior cooperation.
choose-if: resources >= 2 and razem_cooperation >= 48 and party_unity >= 42
unavailable-subtitle: Too little trust remains for another paper settlement.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; razem_split = 0; razem_active = 1; razem_in_left = 1; razem_in_left_club = 1; razem_party_formed = 0; razem_opposition_circle = 0; razem_dissent -= 12; razem_cooperation += 8; budget_promises += 3; ko_relation -= 4; psl_relation -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 4; party_unity += 4; news_headline = "A binding support protocol postpones the Left's expected rupture"
go-to: poland_event_queue

@razem_absorb
title: Bring the cooperative five into New Left and isolate Zandberg
on-arrival: {!
const razemCurrentSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.razem_seats) || 0)
);
const oppositionSeats = Math.min(
    razemCurrentSeats,
    Math.max(1, razemCurrentSeats - 5)
);
const cooperativeSeats = Math.max(0, razemCurrentSeats - oppositionSeats);
const razemExitStrength = Math.max(
    1,
    Number(Q.razem_strength) || 0
);
Q.razem_split = 1;
Q.razem_active = 0;
Q.razem_in_left = 0;
Q.razem_in_left_club = 0;
Q.razem_party_formed = 1;
Q.razem_party_relation = 18;
Q.razem_opposition_circle = 1;
Q.razem_exit_strength = razemExitStrength;
Q.razem_strength = 0;
Q.razem_dissent = 100;
Q.progressives_strength += razemExitStrength * 0.75;
Q.labor_strength += razemExitStrength * 0.10;
Q.party_unity -= 5;
Q.razem_cooperation -= 16;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) - oppositionSeats);
Q.razem_party_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.razem_party_seats) || 0) + oppositionSeats;
Q.left_new_generation_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_new_generation_seats) || 0) +
    cooperativeSeats;
Q.razem_seats = 0;
Q.zandberg_advisor = 0;
Q.zawisza_advisor = 0;
Q.matysiak_advisor = 0;
Q.seat_subvention_seats = Q.left_seats;
Q.news_headline =
    "The governing left absorbs the cooperative five and creates a separate Razem rival";
!}
go-to: poland_event_queue

